The '''Rainbug Shard''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Shard]] that grants the {{Attr|Miracle Chance}} [[Attribute]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Safari Bells ===
The '''Rainbug Shard''' cannot be obtained as an individual [[Shard]]. Instead, its {{Attr|Miracle Chance}} [[Attribute]] can be obtained and leveled up by completing a quest in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

There are {{Green|7}} {{Item|Bell|link=}}s scattered around the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} at different locations. Upon finding all {{Green|7}} {{Item|Bell|link=}}s and returning to {{NPCSprite|"Hunter" Tobias}}, a cutscene begins to play. For the sake of spoilers, the following section will be hidden.

